## Contrast with QSLP-AE (do not conflate)

| QSLP-AE (Ciudad et al.) | Our report |
|------------------------|------------|
| Human + mouse alignment | Mouse-only, cross-**laboratory** holdout |
| Style / task disentanglement via permutation | Subject nuisance via **decoder-only** embedding |
| 2-d task latent for visualization | Mixture prior + optional $K$-sweep substates |
| Contrastive vs reconstruction ablation | Model **ladder** (HMM → HMMGMVAE → cGMVAE → cHMM) |
| Accuracy probes on latents | Prior-prediction **NMI** vs expert macro labels |

Cite colleague work when discussing shared MSSV preprocessing or representation-learning framing; do not claim their results as ours.

