## Quality checklist before hand-in

- [ ] Every figure cited in text before it appears; caption panels match narrative.
- [ ] Methods standalone — readable without Results.
- [ ] Every numeric claim in Results traceable to table, figure, or cited thesis value.
- [ ] Holdout protocol stated in **both** Methods and Fig 1B.
- [ ] K-sweep/substage section states $K$ selection rule even if winner TBD.
- [ ] Limitations paragraph names at least: label noise, lab heterogeneity, seed fragility, incomplete ladder rungs.
- [ ] `texcount` main text **≤ 4,000**; ideally **3,000–3,500** ([`word_budget.md`](word_budget.md))
